 132:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4502F100F768ACXQMA1/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * The Universal Serial Interface Channel(USIC) module is a flexible interface module
 133:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4502F100F768ACXQMA1/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * covering several serial communication protocols. A USIC module contains two
 134:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4502F100F768ACXQMA1/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * independent communication channels named USICx_CH0 and USICx_CH1, with x
 135:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4502F100F768ACXQMA1/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * being the number of the USIC module. The user can program, during run-time, which protocol will 
 136:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4502F100F768ACXQMA1/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * by each communication channel and which pins are used.
 137:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4502F100F768ACXQMA1/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * The driver provides APIs, configuration structures and enumerations to configure common features
 138:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4502F100F768ACXQMA1/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * communication protocols.
