 112:D:/Projekty/TrinityTrack6000/MainControlBoard/Infineon/XMC4502F100F768ACXQMA1/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_i2c.h ****  * @brief Inter Integrated Circuit(IIC) driver for the XMC microcontroller family.
